	],
	"notice": "Upper, lower and pedal manuals have separate configurable MIDI channels. The additional Bass Pedal MIDI IN is distinct from the ordinary MIDI input. Swell uses CC4, not the CC11 expression assignment used by several Nord piano models. Match the instrument MIDI channel and receive filters before sending notes or CCs. USB carries MIDI/data rather than audio; connect the audio outputs separately. Consult the download page for the correct Windows USB driver. Port aliases have not been verified on hardware; select the profile manually. The drawings are selected-control schematics rather than scale panel plans. Keyboard and panel controls remain unbound; splits, octave shifts and layer routing can change their behavior. Only the listed CCs are supplied, not the full MIDI implementation.",
